package:
  name: hdllint.jg
  desc: JasperGold superlint integration (`jg`)
  doc: |
    JasperGold as a lint tool via superlint batch mode. It runs
    `jg -superlint -batch <tcl_script>` and parses the superlint
    report (CSV or text) into normalized findings.

    It implements the `Rtl` family and no other.

    JasperGold is the property of its respective owners.

  imports:
  - name: hdllint

  tasks:
  - export: Rtl
    uses: hdllint.Rtl
    desc: Runs JasperGold superlint and reports normalized findings
    doc: |
      The `hdllint.Rtl` family task with `tools:` pinned to JasperGold.
      Identical in every other respect -- same waivers, same baseline, same
      reports.

      Use this when a flow wants JasperGold specifically; use `hdllint.Rtl`
      when it wants whatever lint tools are available.

      ```yaml
      - name: lint
        uses: hdllint.jg.Rtl
        needs: [rtl]
        with:
          top: [my_top]
          profile: strict
      ```

      Profiles map to JasperGold superlint modes as:

      | profile   | mode                          |
      |-----------|-------------------------------|
      | `basic`   | default superlint             |
      | `default` | full (`-superlint_full`)      |
      | `strict`  | full + advisory               |
    with:
      tools:
        type: list
        value: [jg]
